      "options": {
        "content": "## 怎么选\n- [充电记录](/d/TSmNYvRRk/charges?var-car_id=$car_id)：每次充电的地点、电量、时长和费用。\n- [充电统计](/d/-pkIkhmRz/charging-stats?var-car_id=$car_id)：交流/直流占比、热力图、曲线和站点排行。\n- [充电费用统计](/d/jchmDdLe5uFVk/charging-costs?var-car_id=$car_id)：费用、电量、免费充电和月度统计。\n- [充电电量](/d/WopVO_mgz/charging-energy?var-car_id=$car_id)：电量变化概览。\n- [充电健康管理](/d/charging-health-cn/charging-health?var-car_id=$car_id)：时长、功率和异常充电识别。\n- [快充曲线统计](/d/jchmXpkIkhmRz/charging-curve?var-car_id=$car_id)：直流快充功率曲线。\n- [快充曲线图（按运营商）](/d/jchmXpkcccIkh/dc-curves-carrier?var-car_id=$car_id)：比较不同运营商表现。\n- [充电桩性价比榜](/d/station-ranking/station-ranking?var-car_id=$car_id)：按每度电价格和综合成本排行。",
